{
  "slug": "turkey-lentil-skillet",
  "name": "Turkey and lentil skillet",
  "description": "Ground turkey breast browned with onion and cumin, simmered with cooked lentils and tomato and finished with wilted spinach.",
  "iconKey": "pot",
  "instructions": [
    "Dice the onion and the tomato, then season the ground turkey breast with the ground cumin and the salt.",
    "Warm the olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat, add the onion and cook for 4 minutes, until it softens.",
    "Add the turkey breast and cook for 6 minutes, breaking it up with a spoon, until no pink remains.",
    "Stir in the cooked lentils and the tomato and simmer for 5 minutes, until the pan is thick and glossy.",
    "Fold the spinach through the skillet off the heat until it just wilts, then divide it between two plates."
